categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"sLO6aA8CI4QZXm-sGC6yyQ","review_id":"JX1ldgTvWuAdMXOPximPiw","date":"2013-07-02T00:30:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9419143199920654,"text_excerpt":"It's places like the Vine and Dine that make Algiers Point such a great place. I'm lucky enough to live down the street and stop by for a bottle to take home from time to time. Vine and Dine has a great menu-- you really can't go wrong with anything, and the staff make excellent pairing suggestions. Happy Hour changes throughout the year and makes for a great excuse to stop in. It's right off the ferry, so it's easy to get to!"},{"business_id":"sLO6aA8CI4QZXm-sGC6yyQ","review_id":"CghFmhprYE39AllGMATYrQ","date":"2015-03-26T16:17:42","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9327487945556641,"text_excerpt":"Living in the Algiers area, and the Westbank in general, I have always thought that in order to find a good, classy restaurant or bar meant a trip across the river. At least as far as wine bars go, I now know that there is a great little gem right here in the Point. I had spotted Vine and Dine before, next door to the Dry Dock and across the street from the Canal Street Ferry, but never thought to try it out. I finally have and I am so glad that I did! The place is funky, with lots of eclectic artwork adorning the walls, but is still classy and intimate, perfect for a date night or a get together with friends. As you walk through the bar, you will find there is a patio outside for enjoyin..."},{"business_id":"sLO6aA8CI4QZXm-sGC6yyQ","review_id":"8Gydr_llZaso0vBrvLG1og","date":"2013-07-21T15:07:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9191120862960815,"text_excerpt":"One of the best restaurants in Algiers Point, we eat here about once a week. The wine deals are excellent - buy a bottle, drink it while you are there and take it with you when you go. I love the gumbo and the focaccia's are delicious!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"sLO6aA8CI4QZXm-sGC6yyQ","photo_id":"9pYMplePUvqL-0sLs4pikg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/9pYMplePUvqL-0sLs4pikg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9759975671768188},{"business_id":"sLO6aA8CI4QZXm-sGC6yyQ","photo_id":"fgZLOZzZ3M4vi7Ai1OB8jg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/fgZLOZzZ3M4vi7Ai1OB8jg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9759974479675293}]},"notebook_case":null}
